<h1>CSA43 - Internet Programming Assessment Tool 3</h1>

<!-- Question 1 -->

<div class="card">

<h2>Question 1 - HTML Video Tag</h2>

<p><b>Choose the correct HTML tag for video embedding.</b></p>

<div class="options">
<div>A. &lt;media src="video.mp4"&gt;&lt;/media&gt;</div>
<div class="correct">B. &lt;video src="video.mp4" controls&gt;&lt;/video&gt;</div>
<div>C. &lt;movie src="video.mp4"&gt;&lt;/movie&gt;</div>
<div>D. &lt;vid src="video.mp4"&gt;&lt;/vid&gt;</div>
</div>

<div class="answer">

<b>Answer:</b> Option B

<br><br>

The <b>&lt;video&gt;</b> tag is the official HTML5 element used to embed videos.

</div>

<video controls autoplay muted loop>

<source src="https://www.w3schools.com/html/mov_bbb.mp4" type="video/mp4">

</video>

</div>

<!-- Question 2 -->

<div class="card">

<h2>Question 2 - HTTP Method</h2>

<p><b>Select the correct HTTP method.</b></p>

<div class="options">

<div>GET</div>

<div class="correct">POST</div>

<div>PUT</div>

<div>DELETE</div>

</div>

<div class="answer">

<b>Answer:</b> POST

<br><br>

POST sends user information inside the request body, making it suitable for registration forms.

</div>

<form method="POST">

<input type="text" placeholder="Full Name">

<input type="email" placeholder="Email">

<input type="password" placeholder="Password">

<button type="submit">Register</button>

</form>

</div>

<!-- Question 3 -->

<div class="card">

<h2>Question 3 - Semantic Navigation</h2>

<p><b>Choose the semantic navigation element.</b></p>

<div class="options">

<div>&lt;div&gt;</div>

<div class="correct">&lt;nav&gt;</div>

<div>&lt;section&gt;</div>

<div>&lt;header&gt;</div>

</div>

<div class="answer">

<b>Answer:</b> &lt;nav&gt;

<br><br>

The NAV element represents the navigation links of a website.

</div>

<nav class="sampleNav">

<a href="#">Home</a>

<a href="#">About</a>

<a href="#">Services</a>

<a href="#">Contact</a>

</nav>

</div>

<!-- Question 4 -->

<div class="card">

<h2>Question 4 - XML Syntax</h2>

<p><b>Choose the correct XML syntax.</b></p>

<pre>
A. &lt;note&gt;&lt;to&gt;User&lt;/to&gt;&lt;from&gt;Admin&lt;/from&gt;

B. &lt;note&gt;
   &lt;to&gt;User&lt;/to&gt;
   &lt;from&gt;Admin&lt;/from&gt;
   &lt;/note&gt;

C. &lt;note&gt;&lt;to&gt;User&lt;/from&gt;&lt;/note&gt;

D. &lt;note to="User"&gt;&lt;/note
</pre>

<div class="answer">

<b>Correct Answer:</b> Option B

<ul>

<li>A → Missing closing &lt;/note&gt;</li>

<li>B → Properly opened and closed tags ✔</li>

<li>C → Closing tag mismatch</li>

<li>D → Missing > in closing tag</li>

</ul>

</div>

</div>

<!-- Question 5 -->

<div class="card">

<h2>Question 5 - Web Protocol</h2>

<p><b>Choose the protocol used between browser and server.</b></p>

<div class="options">

<div>FTP</div>

<div class="correct">HTTP</div>

<div>SMTP</div>

<div>SNMP</div>

</div>

<div class="answer">

<b>Answer:</b> HTTP

<br><br>

HTTP (HyperText Transfer Protocol) is used for communication between web browsers and web servers.

</div>

<h3 style="margin-top:20px;text-align:center;">

Browser ➜ HTTP ➜ Web Server

</h3>

